{"id":"98838138a402c043","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-rewrite-rule.md","title":"df-rewrite-rule","display":"df-rewrite-rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"label":"56-df-rewrite-rule","aliases":["56-df-rewrite-rule"],"display":"df-rewrite-rule","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-rewrite-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-rewrite-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rewrite-rule"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-rewrite-rule\"><code>df-rewrite-rule</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l,r\\in T\">\\(l,r\\in T\\)</span>；有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(l,r)\">\\((l,r)\\)</span> 的规则写法为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\to r\">\\(l\\to r\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{(l,r)\\in T\\times T\\mid l\\notin\\mathcal V\\land\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{(l,r)\\in T\\times T\\mid l\\notin\\mathcal V\\land\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rule}(l\\to r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rule}(l\\to r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则左侧不是变量，右侧不引入新变量；规则是有序项对。签名与变量集固定时允许 Rule 的上下文省略。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，定义2.2.1，印刷第35页，OCR页块56。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-rewrite-rule","text":"`df-rewrite-rule`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]，$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]，$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"l,r\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"(l,r)","display":false},{"tex":"l\\to r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{(l,r)\\in T\\times T\\mid l\\notin\\mathcal V\\land\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rule}(l\\to r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).","display":true}],"bytes":1108,"backlinks":[{"id":"8133fc32a2cf7026","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,V,T$ 及合法规则集 $R$ 如 [[56-df-rewrite-rule]]，$x\\in V$、$l,r,t\\in T$。位置和子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]。"},{"id":"ae58bbf1212091b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定签名 $\\Sigma$、变量集 $\\mathcal V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$。$\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 表示 [[56-df-rewrite-rule]] 中合法无条件规则的集合。条件列表 $c$ 是 $T\\times T$ 的有限序列；$(l,r,c)$ 编码 $l\\to r\\Leftarrow c_1\\approx d_1,\\ldots,c_k\\approx d_k$。条件中的变量可以不出现在 $l$ 中。"},{"id":"4e0030b331726af9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,V,T$ 同 [[56-df-rewrite-rule]]（$V$ 实例化其 $\\mathcal V$）；$\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$；$l,r,l',r',l_0,r_0,l_1,r_1\\in T$。$\\mathrm{Variant}$ 的两个项对参数取自 $T^2$，不要求它们是合法规则。置换也视为值域在 $V\\subseteq T$ 内的替换，见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。"},{"id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R$ 为集合；规则集合取 [[56-df-rewrite-rule]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-rule.md]]"},{"id":"9871b3f02563bee2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","491e726b9c1f42b0"]}